---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Terms of Use — RigGamer"
  description="RigGamer Terms of Use. Read the rules governing your use of riggamer.com."
>
<div class="legal-wrap">
  <div class="legal-inner">

    <div class="legal-hero">
      <div class="legal-kicker">// Legal</div>
      <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="legal-meta">Last updated: <strong>September 20, 2026</strong> &nbsp;·&nbsp; Applies to: <strong>riggamer.com</strong></p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-body">

      <h2>1. Acceptance</h2>
      <p>By accessing or using RigGamer (<strong>riggamer.com</strong>), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Use. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.</p>

      <h2>2. Content and Copyright</h2>
      <p>All content on RigGamer — including text, images, graphics, code, and design — is the property of RigGamer or its licensors and is protected by intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, or republish any content without prior written permission, except for personal, non-commercial use.</p>
      <p>Screenshots and game imagery used in articles remain the property of their respective game publishers and are used under fair use / editorial purposes.</p>

      <h2>3. Affiliate Links and Sponsored Content</h2>
      <p>RigGamer contains affiliate links. When you click a "Play Free" or similar link and complete a qualifying action, we may earn a commission. This does not affect the price you pay — the games linked are free to play. See our <a href="/disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a> for full details.</p>
      <p>Some content on RigGamer may be sponsored or paid for by game publishers. Such content is clearly labelled where required by applicable law.</p>

      <h2>4. Accuracy of Information</h2>
      <p>We strive to keep game guides, reviews, and news accurate and up to date. However, game content changes frequently. We do not guarantee the accuracy, completeness, or timeliness of any information on RigGamer. Use the information at your own risk.</p>

      <h2>5. External Links</h2>
      <p>RigGamer links to third-party websites including game stores, developer sites, and affiliate networks. We are not responsible for the content or practices of external sites. Following a link is at your own discretion.</p>

      <h2>6. User Conduct</h2>
      <p>You agree not to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Use the site for any unlawful purpose</li>
        <li>Attempt to gain unauthorised access to any part of the site</li>
        <li>Scrape or harvest content from RigGamer at scale without permission</li>
        <li>Use automated tools to generate artificial traffic or clicks</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>7. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p>RigGamer is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind, either express or implied. We do not warrant that the site will be uninterrupted, error-free, or free of viruses or other harmful components.</p>

      <h2>8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, RigGamer and its operators shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of the site or its content.</p>

      <h2>9. Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>We may revise these Terms at any time. Continued use of RigGamer after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.</p>

      <h2>10. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>These Terms are governed by applicable law. Any disputes shall be resolved through good-faith negotiation before resorting to formal proceedings.</p>

      <h2>11. Contact</h2>
      <p>For legal enquiries: <a href="mailto:contact@riggamer.com">contact@riggamer.com</a></p>

    </div>

    <div class="legal-footer-nav">
      <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>
      <a href="/cookies/">Cookie Policy</a>
      <a href="/disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
</Base>

<style>
.legal-wrap { background: var(--bg); padding: 48px 0 80px; }
.legal-inner { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }
.legal-hero { margin-bottom: 40px; padding-bottom: 28px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd); }
.legal-kicker { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--volt); margin-bottom: 12px; }
.legal-hero h1 { font-family: var(--fd); font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px); font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.legal-meta { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: 13px; color: var(--t4); }
.legal-body h2 { font-family: var(--fd); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .03em; margin: 2em 0 .7em; padding-bottom: 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd); }
.legal-body p { color: var(--t2); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 1em; }
.legal-body ul { color: var(--t2); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; margin: .5em 0 1em 1.4em; }
.legal-body ul li { margin-bottom: .4em; }
.legal-body a { color: var(--volt); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(198,255,51,.3); transition: border-color .15s; }
.legal-body a:hover { border-color: var(--volt); }
.legal-footer-nav { display: flex; gap: 20px; margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--brd); flex-wrap: wrap; }
.legal-footer-nav a { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: 12px; color: var(--t3); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; transition: color .15s; }
.legal-footer-nav a:hover { color: var(--volt); }
</style>
